<title>USA: Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak-off $0.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Indiana/Ohio direct hogs weak-off $0.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts opened weak to $0.50 lower. Demand and movement were light to moderate. Top $57.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>			    Country			     Plants</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs. 55.50-56.50, Few 55.00 &amp; 57.00 56.00-57.50</p>
